{
  "tema": 5974,
  "slug": "por-intercambio",
  "titulo": "Por (not para) for an exchange",
  "subtitulo": "Cambio pesos por dólares: por = in exchange for.",
  "foto": "t09.jpg",
  "regla": "Use por (not para) for an exchange or trade: cambiar pesos por dólares; te doy mi tabla por la tuya.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "To express an **exchange** or **trade**, use **por**, never **para**: _for_ = _in exchange for_."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "It's very common with **cambiar** (_to swap, to exchange_), **dar** and **pagar**: **te doy mi café por tu té**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: think of a swap meet, a **trueque**: something goes, something comes, and **por** sits in the middle."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "Voy a cambiar pesos ==por== dólares.",
              "en": "I'm going to change pesos for dollars."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿Me das un café ==por== mi té?",
              "en": "Will you give me a coffee for my tea?"
            },
            {
              "es": "Su papá cambia estampas ==por== chicles.",
              "en": "His dad swaps stickers for gum."
            },
            {
              "es": "Te cambio mi tabla corta ==por== tu longboard.",
              "en": "I'll trade you my shortboard for your longboard."
            },
            {
              "es": "Gracias ==por== todo.",
              "en": "Thanks for everything. (in return for)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "trampa",
      "titulo": "The trap",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "pares",
          "lista": [
            {
